:: ChurchPray [nobr] {"position":"1975,1500","size":"100,100"}
<<image "scenes/church/1.jpg" { width: "100%" }>><br>

<<narration>>Father Ibrahim looks up from the altar.<</narration>>
<<say "Father Ibrahim">>Bless you, my daughter. How may I assist you?<</say>><br>
<<if setup.Church.canRequestExorcism()>>
	@@.enterbtn; [[I need to talk to Rain|RainExorcism]]@@<br>
<</if>>
<<if setup.Church.shouldRedirectToNunQuest()>>
	<<goto "ChurchNunQuest">>
<</if>>
<<if setup.Church.canFlirtWithPriest()>>
	<<linkreplace "@@.usebtn;Flirt with him@@">>
		<<if setup.Church.priestSexOnCooldown()>>
			<<say>>Enough for today, come to me tomorrow<</say>>
		<<elseif setup.Church.meetsBeautyForFlirt()>>
			<<mc>>I didn't come for a confession...I want to feel your [[big hard cock inside me|ToolsEventChurch]]<</mc>><br>
		<<else>>
			<<say>>I have a lot to do...maybe later<</say>><br>
			@@.warningtext; (Req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.BEAUTY>> ≥ 45)@@
		<</if>>
	<</linkreplace>><br>
<</if>>
<<linkreplace "@@.usebtn;Start confession with a priest@@">>
	<<mc>>Bless me, father. I feel that I haven't always been fair and kind to others. Sometimes I've harbored anger and resentment<</mc>><br>
	<<say>>Thank you for your sincere confession. Remember, the Lord is always ready to forgive if you sincerely repent of your sins. Accept correction and strive for virtue<</say>><br>
	<<mc>>Thank you, father. I will pray and endeavor to be better<</mc>><br>
	<<say>>May the peace and grace of the Lord be with you. Go in peace, my daughter<</say>><br>
	<br>
	Your <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.HEALTH>> is decreased
	<<run setup.Church.clearLust()>>

<</linkreplace>>
<br>
<<if setup.Church.canAskAboutLevel3Tools()>>
	<<linkreplace "@@.usebtn;Ask about level 3 tools@@">>
		<<mc>>I wanted to ask you something. I was told that you have one of the level 3 tools for detecting ghosts. I would really like to get it, I really need it<</mc>><br>
		<<if setup.Church.meetsBeautyForLevel3Tools()>>
			<<if setup.Church.priestWillTradeToolForSex()>>
				<<say>>Yes, I have a level 3 thermometer. Of course, I understand that this item is very valuable. This thing is for real professionals. I could give it to you, but I'd like to get something [[in return...|ToolsEventChurch]]<</say>><br>
			<<else>>
				<<say>>Yes, i have a level 3 thermometer. Of course, I understand that this item is very valuable. This thing is for real professionals. It's not often that beautiful girls like you come here. I could give it to you, but I'd like to get something in return...<</say>><br>
				<<thought>>What the fuck. This is a priest, why does he hint at such things, well, no, this is not for me.<</thought>><br>
				@@.warningtext; (Req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.CORRUPTION>> ≥ 4)@@
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<say>>Yes, I have a level 3 thermometer, but I don't think I can trust you with it, sorry<</say>><br>
			<<thought>>Damn! I really need this thing. What should I do to get his attention?<</thought>><br>
			@@.warningtext; (Req. <<statIcon setup.StatIcon.BEAUTY>> ≥ 45)@@
		<</if>>
	<</linkreplace>>
<</if>>
<br>
<br>
@@.backbtn;[[Leave|CityMap]] @@<br>
